  "dct_description_sm": [
    "These data were collected to increase our understanding of forest and soil processes at the latitudinal treeline of Labrador. Kamistastin represents a significant place for Innu people who have occupied this area seasonally for thousands of years. This dataset represents a preliminary investigation into the climatic and ecological factors associated with forest and soil systems."
